(circle_d100.nc - test pattern for Grbl Sender)
(Circle, diameter 100 mm, centred on the CURRENT tool position)
(TOOL D=3.175 flat end mill)
(Uses relative moves - no zeroing needed. No Z moves and no spindle:)
(set the pen/tool height by jogging before you press Run.)
G21 (millimetres)
G17 (XY plane)
G91 (relative moves from here on)
G0 X-50 Y0 (rapid to the left edge of the circle)
G2 X0 Y0 I50 J0 F300 (full clockwise circle around the start point)
G0 X50 Y0 (back to the centre)
G90 (absolute moves again)
M2 (end of program)
